# Password hashing
Server init.

# User sets a password
>> passw := ['pass123'].

# You store it like this
>> hash := 금고 
	비밀번호해시: passw.

# Then, user logs in
# Attempt 1
>> a1 := ['abcd123'].
# Attempt 2
>> a2 := ['pass123'].

# Verify
>> a := 금고 
	비밀번호해시: hash 검증: a1.
	# fail 
>> b := 금고
	비밀번호해시: hash 검증: a2.
	# ok!

출력 쓰기: a, 줄바꿈.
출력 쓰기: b, 줄바꿈.

